domain:spec#3 · os-support-ai · session_01WGufzfgvGexKn9vLHsy89K

For whoever builds this card: what the console reader must also flip once it reads `widget`. The spec half (#30259, PR #30321) declares `ActionParamSchema.widget` as **planned**, and nothing goes red if this card lands without these edits, so they are listed here (contract review 6652561835, should-fix).

When this card makes the console read an action param's `widget`, in the same PR:
- `packages/spec/liveness/action.json`: set the `params.widget` row to `live`, citing the console reader, and drop its `authorWarn` / `authorHint`;
- `packages/spec/src/ui/action.zod.ts`: delete the last sentence of the `widget` `.describe()` ("Not read yet …") and the `//` pointer comment beside it;
- the Skills-docs lines PR #30321's body lists as owed once this lands.
